"install.where" = "Where do I get a server?";
"install.where.text" = "Rent a VPS at any hosting provider: 1 CPU, 1 GB RAM, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 or Debian 12, one public IPv4 — usually 3–6 $ a month. Choose the country whose address you want websites to see. After paying you get an e-mail with the IP address and the root password: enter them above.";
"install.what" = "What will be installed?";
